 "sq": [
  {
   "_id": 18033,
   "ANSWER": "<p><br data-end=\"1431\" data-start=\"1428\" />\nThe <code data-end=\"1443\" data-start=\"1435\">fork()</code> system call is used to <strong data-end=\"1491\" data-start=\"1467\">create a new process</strong> by duplicating the calling (parent) process. It returns <strong data-end=\"1553\" data-start=\"1548\">0</strong> to the child process and <strong data-end=\"1599\" data-start=\"1579\">PID of the child</strong> to the parent process, allowing both processes to run independently.</p>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC202J",
   "LEVEL": 1,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO2",
    "PLO1"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<h3 data-end=\"1416\" data-start=\"1355\"><strong data-end=\"1414\" data-start=\"1359\">What is the purpose of the <code data-end=\"1399\" data-start=\"1391\">fork()</code> system call?</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"1668\" data-start=\"1417\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
   "SESSION_ID": 204,
   "TYPE": "sq",
   "key": 18033
  },
  {
   "_id": 18034,
   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"1760\" data-start=\"1747\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1991\" data-start=\"1761\">\n\t<li data-end=\"1826\" data-start=\"1761\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1826\" data-start=\"1763\"><code data-end=\"1773\" data-start=\"1763\">getpid()</code> returns the <strong data-end=\"1800\" data-start=\"1786\">Process ID</strong> of the current process.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1991\" data-start=\"1827\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1991\" data-start=\"1829\"><code data-end=\"1840\" data-start=\"1829\">getppid()</code> returns the <strong data-end=\"1874\" data-start=\"1853\">Parent Process ID</strong> of the current process.<br data-end=\"1901\" data-start=\"1898\" />\n\tThese are useful for tracking and managing parent-child relationships in process creation.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC202J",
   "LEVEL": 2,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO2",
    "PLO1",
    "PLO3"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<h3 data-end=\"1746\" data-start=\"1675\"><strong data-end=\"1744\" data-start=\"1679\">Explain the difference between <code data-end=\"1725\" data-start=\"1715\">getpid()</code> and <code data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1730\">getppid()</code>.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"1760\" data-start=\"1747\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1991\" data-start=\"1761\">\n\t<li data-end=\"1991\" data-start=\"1827\">&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1668\" data-start=\"1417\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
